---@class github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequest
---@field owner string The account owner of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.
---@field repo string The name of the repository. The name is not case sensitive.
---@field automation_id string The unique identifier of the automation.
---@field name? string The name of the automation.
---@field enabled? boolean Set to true to enable, false to disable. Omit to leave unchanged.
---@field require_actor_write_permission? boolean When true, event-triggered runs require the event actor to have repo write permission, even when the org's allow_read_access_triggers policy is enabled. When policy validation is enabled, explicitly setting false returns 422 if effective organization or repository policy disallows read-access triggers. The actor requirement does not apply to interval-scheduled runs, which always run as the automation owner. Omit to leave unchanged.
---@field continuous_history? boolean When true, runs of this automation build on the session history of its previous runs, and runs of the same automation are serialized. Not tracked in revision history. Omit to leave unchanged.
---@field model? string The model to use for sessions triggered by this automation. Omit to leave unchanged. Send an empty string to clear the override and let the platform select the model.
---@field reasoning_effort? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequestReasoningEffort The reasoning effort to use for sessions triggered by this automation. Omit to leave unchanged. Send an empty string to clear the override and use the model's default.
---@field triggers? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequestTriggers Trigger configuration for the automation.
---@field prompt? string The prompt for the automation.
---@field tools? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequestToolsList The tools available to the automation. Send an empty array to clear all tools.

---The reasoning effort to use for sessions triggered by this automation. Omit to leave unchanged. Send an empty string to clear the override and use the model's default.
---@alias github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequestReasoningEffort string|github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationRequestReasoningEffortCase1|string

