---@class github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationResponse
---@field id string The unique identifier of the automation.
---@field name string The name of the automation.
---@field enabled? boolean Whether the automation is currently enabled.
---@field type? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationResponseType The type of automation. `personal` keeps it private to its creator and its runs act as that user. `shared` makes it belong to the repository, visible to anyone with read access to the repository, and its runs act as the Copilot app rather than as a person.
---@field require_actor_write_permission? boolean When true, event-triggered runs require the event actor to have repo write permission, even when the org's allow_read_access_triggers policy is enabled. Does not apply to interval-scheduled runs, which always run as the automation owner.
---@field continuous_history? boolean When true, runs of this automation build on the session history of its previous runs, and runs of the same automation are serialized. Not tracked in revision history.
---@field triggers? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationResponseTriggers Trigger configuration for the automation.
---@field prompt string The prompt for the automation.
---@field tools? github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationResponseToolsList The tools available to the automation.
---@field model? string The model override for sessions triggered by this automation. Absent when the platform selects the model.
---@field reasoning_effort? string The reasoning effort override for sessions triggered by this automation. Absent when the model's default is used.
---@field created_at string When the automation was created.
---@field updated_at string When the automation was last updated.
---@field created_by github.agent_automations.EditRepoAutomationResponseCreatedBy A GitHub user

---A GitHub user
